   946	   (power-of-two alignment, size a multiple of alignment, in-bounds non-overlapping fields, unique
   947	   discriminants, valid tag decoding), proved for the native, C and packed algorithms, with the
   948	   existing `i32` enum tags and no niches ([questions 4 and 5](../decisions.md#foundation-q4)).
   949	   `Values`: `Val`, `Val.HasTy` and `Rep`, porting `Spec/Rep.lean`: `rep_roundtrip` keeps its name
   950	   and statement over `Layout`, and `Rep` is deleted in this step. `Secret<T>` has `T`'s layout
   951	   ([question 18](../decisions.md#foundation-q18)).
