   963	   `Span`'s column counts bytes and a tab counts one byte ([question 10](../decisions.md#foundation-q10)).
   964	9. `Fragments`: `Fragment.surface` and `Fragment.core` for slices 0 and 1, and the "not supported in
   965	   this slice" rule (D19). The old slice-0 syntax, `toCore` and its proofs stay until step 24; a
   966	   lemma relates `Fragment.core s0` to the image of `toCore`. The `check`/`run` examples of
   967	   `Spec/Slice0.lean` move to `Spec/Examples.lean` here.
   968	10. `Evidence`, as far as slices 0 and 1 need (interval admission moved from `nht:Ownership`,
   969	    evidence sources, the evidence graph), `Obligations` with no schemas yet, `Typing` (from
   970	    `Statics`) and the new `Ownership` (the old `Ownership` rules restated over Core syntax, C5's
   971	    static half), so the static chain of 2.2 exists before `Admission`. The old one stays, as
