  1005	    sequencing, scope restoration and cleanup preservation. Port `Cleanup` whole: frames, exits,
  1006	    late reads, `defer_cleanup_releases` with all five conclusions (its dependency order uses
  1007	    `Ty.brands`, present since step 3), `abort_no_cleanup`; O8. Delete `Cleanup.*`. When an old
