  1038	**Porting a feature fragment.** When an old fragment's run takes an oracle (`σ` for loop
  1039	tests in `Brand`, `ok` for deferred calls in `Cleanup`), the correspondence goes in the realizable
  1040	direction: every integrated run determines an oracle (its actual condition outcomes and call
  1041	results) under which the old run agrees with it. The old theorems, which hold for every oracle, then
  1042	apply to the integrated run, and are restated without the oracle in the same commit.
