   343	| Domain | Where | State |
   344	|---|---|---|
   345	| ownership ghost (`Slot.moved`; `Entry.used`, `live`, `known`, `kfields`) | `Spec/Semantics.lean:23`, `Spec/Ownership.lean:17` | erasure stated as intent only (O3) |
   775	
