   779	| D2 | The octagon checker, its limits and closed evidence (Q2, Q4, Q7–Q9) | `Evidence` | fact language, transfers, limits as spec constants, evidence sources, evidence graph; a fact not established at a site is a refusal of kind `notEstablished` | intervals at 0; octagons at 3 |
